Package: CounterfactMe
Title: Generate Random Counterfactual Lives Based on Norwegian Open Data
Version: 0.9.28
Authors@R:
    person("Martin", "Isungset", , "martinisungset@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: What if you had been someone else? CounterfactMe generates random
    counterfactual Norwegian lives from open SSB data. Each call to
    counterfact_me() returns a coherent life across 33 dimensions — name,
    age, education, occupation, income, family structure (parents, siblings,
    grandparents), housing (with hytte), wealth (with inheritance flow),
    immigrant background, religion, party preference, and a Bourdieu-style
    class profile. Dimensions are conditionally sampled in sociologically
    realistic order.
